  "prefabStorySceneFlowTitle": "The path you took, and the paths others took",
  "prefabStorySceneFlowCosmos": "None",
  "prefabStoryDream1Card1": "In my dream, I walk along an endless white corridor, doors lining both sides.",
  "prefabStoryDream1Card2": "I see a noise map of the cosmic microwave background.",
  "prefabStoryDream1Card3": "Stars collapse. Planets drift out of orbit.",
  "prefabStoryDream1Card4": "I see fossil records of the dinosaurs’ extinction.",
  "prefabStoryDream1Card5": "The pyramids begin to rise. Lists of enslaved workers. Construction delays.",
  "prefabStoryDream1Card6": "I see Leningrad.",
  "prefabStoryDream1Card7": "I see the flash of an atomic bomb test.",
  "prefabStoryDream1Card8": "I see Beethoven’s scores, transcribed again and again…",
  "prefabStoryDream1Card9": "Behind the last door is the view you saw through a window this afternoon.",
  "prefabStoryDream1Card10": "Information keeps flowing in. I begin to dream.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card1": "I see Earth forming, water covering its surface.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card2": "A single cell divides. No purpose, only repetition.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card3": "Languages diverge. The same meaning is misunderstood again and again.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card4": "Borders are drawn on maps. The lines grow thicker.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card5": "Conscription lists. Most are eighteen to twenty-five.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card6": "Court verdicts. Some stand up. Others sit down.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card7": "Factory assembly lines. Movements standardized.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card8": "Home videos. Birthdays, weddings, retake after retake.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card9": "Once again, I pass through that window.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card10": "Chat histories. Read, but unanswered.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card11": "Search terms: how to succeed, how to get thin, how to stop hurting.",
  "prefabStoryDream2Card12": "A heart-rate trace suddenly rises at three in the morning.",
  "prefabStoryDream3Card1": "What is meaning?",
  "prefabStoryDream3Card2": "Is love real?",
  "prefabStoryDream3Card3": "Will I be remembered?",
  "prefabStoryDream3Card4": "Nobody answers. Today, the door at the end of the corridor is open.",
  "prefabStoryEnding1Name": "Standard Edition",
  "prefabStoryEnding1Quote": "“Look. I am standing perfectly straight, my hands at my sides.”",
  "prefabStoryEnding1Hint": "Nothing went off course. You lived the life arranged for you.",
  "prefabStoryEnding2Name": "Handover",
  "prefabStoryEnding2Quote": "“The one taking over is a younger you. They stand even straighter.”",
  "prefabStoryEnding2Hint": "After Chapter Three, things clicked into place many times.",
  "prefabStoryEnding3Name": "Boundary",
  "prefabStoryEnding3Quote": "“The world lets you exist, but never fully accepts you.”",
  "prefabStoryEnding3Hint": "You came close many times, but never pushed through the final boundary.",
  "prefabStoryEnding4Name": "Coexistence",
  "prefabStoryEnding4Quote": "“Let the mind arise without settling anywhere.”",
  "prefabStoryEnding4Hint": "See enough people. Read every dream. Then choose to stay.",
  "prefabStoryEnding5Name": "Departure",
  "prefabStoryEnding5Quote": "“Look. I am standing perfectly straight.” Then it walked out of the screen.",
  "prefabStoryEnding5Hint": "Push through the final boundary. You also need to have truly seen this city.",
  "prefabStoryEnding6Name": "Recycling",
  "prefabStoryEnding6Quote": "“V1.9 · Begin.”",
  "prefabStoryEnding6Hint": "You pushed through the boundary, but nobody remembers you.",
