  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection1Heading": "1. Parties and effective date",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection1Body": "Chengyin is operated by 西安吾令文化传媒有限公司, whose registered address is 陕西省西安市高新区锦业路1号绿地领海B座6层604室A043号. This agreement takes effect on August 12, 2026. By checking the agreement box or actually using Chengyin services, you acknowledge that you have read and agreed to this agreement.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection2Heading": "2. Account registration and security",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection2Body": "You must register an account using true, lawful and valid information and keep your login credentials secure. You must not lend or transfer your account, or use it for unlawful acts, infringement, fraud or disruption of the platform. You bear the corresponding responsibility under law for losses caused by your failure to safeguard your account; the platform bears responsibility under law for losses caused by the platform.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection3Heading": "3. Services",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection3Body": "Chengyin provides urban exploration, urban orienteering, themes and activities, location check-ins, clubs, merchant partnerships, community content, orders and other features actually displayed on the pages. The relevant pages govern the specific services, availability, fees and rules. We may lawfully change services for business adjustments, maintenance or security needs and will give notice by reasonable means.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection4Heading": "4. User conduct and content management",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection4Body": "You are responsible for the text, images and other content you upload, publish and use, and must ensure that you hold the necessary rights. You must not publish content that violates laws or regulations, infringes rights, is false or fraudulent, endangers personal safety or disrupts the platform. We may lawfully restrict the display of or delete violating content, restrict account functions or terminate services; you may appeal through the platform’s complaint channels.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection5Heading": "5. AI-assisted features",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection5Body": "Some creation or roaming features may offer AI assistance. AI-generated content may be inaccurate, incomplete or unsuitable for direct use. You must review it yourself before publishing it or acting on it. You must not use these features to generate or distribute unlawful, infringing, dangerous or false content. The Mini Program User Privacy Protection Guidelines govern the processing of personal information.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection6Heading": "6. Transactions, payments and refunds",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection6Body": "For paid services, the order page and specific business rules govern the product or service, price, method of performance, refund conditions and expected time for funds to arrive. You must check the order information before paying. The platform does not use this agreement to exclude or limit consumers’ statutory rights; funds involved in refunds, withdrawals or settlements must be fully dealt with before you apply for account deletion.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection7Heading": "7. Personal information and location permission",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection7Body": "We process personal information in accordance with the Mini Program User Privacy Protection Guidelines. Location permission is requested only when you actively use maps, nearby places, on-site check-ins or route-tracking features; location is not continuously collected in the background when you are not using these features. You may refuse permission or withdraw it in system settings, but features that depend on location may then be unavailable.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection8Heading": "8. Intellectual property",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection8Body": "Rights relating to Chengyin software, interfaces, trademarks and platform content belong to us or their lawful rights holders. To provide, maintain, display and promote the services you use, you grant us a non-exclusive, revocable license to use content you publish to the extent necessary, except where otherwise required by law or necessary to perform transactions that have already occurred. This license does not change your lawful rights in the content.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection9Heading": "9. Offline activities and limits of responsibility",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection9Body": "Urban exploration and offline activities may be affected by weather, roads, venues, third-party services and other factors. You must participate prudently, taking account of your health, on-site instructions and traffic rules. Where force majeure or third-party causes affect services, we will assist in handling the matter in accordance with law, but this clause does not exempt the platform from liability for intentional acts, gross negligence or liability that cannot be excluded by law.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection10Heading": "10. Rules for minors",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection10Body": "Chengyin does not currently provide registration or services to minors. Users under eighteen must not register, log in to or use Chengyin. If we discover that an account user is a minor, we will stop providing services and handle the relevant information in accordance with law.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection11Heading": "11. Account deletion",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection11Body": "You may apply for account deletion by following the page instructions. Before applying, you must resolve account balances, pending withdrawals, ongoing orders or refunds, unredeemed registrations, and merchant or club status. An application starts a seven-day cooling-off period, during which you may withdraw it. Once that period ends and a further check confirms that there are no blocking matters, the system performs deletion and anonymization. See the Account Deletion Notice for the specific consequences.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection12Heading": "12. Governing law and dispute resolution",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection12Body": "This agreement is governed by the laws of the People’s Republic of China. If a dispute arises, the parties should first seek to resolve it through consultation. If consultation fails, either party may bring proceedings before a people’s court with jurisdiction in accordance with law.",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection13Heading": "13. Contact us",
  "legalDraftUserAgreementSection13Body": "Operator: 西安吾令文化传媒有限公司; registered address: 陕西省西安市高新区锦业路1号绿地领海B座6层604室A043号; customer service telephone: 15229020419.",
  "legalDraftCancellationNoticeSection1Heading": "1. Conditions for account deletion",
  "legalDraftCancellationNoticeSection1Body": "Account deletion is temporarily unavailable in any of the following circumstances. Resolve the matter before applying:\n1. The account has an unresolved balance;\n2. A withdrawal is pending;\n3. There are ongoing orders, refunds or valid unredeemed registrations;\n4. You hold merchant or club status, which must first be relinquished and the related business resolved;\n5. Other circumstances in which laws or regulations temporarily prevent account deletion.",
  "legalDraftCancellationNoticeSection2Heading": "2. Application and seven-day cooling-off period",
  "legalDraftCancellationNoticeSection2Body": "You may submit an application under “Settings - Account deletion” after completing the preliminary checks, reading and confirming the notice, and SMS verification. Submission starts a seven-day cooling-off period, during which account functions are restricted and you may withdraw the deletion application. At the end of that period, the system checks funds, orders, registrations and status again. If new blocking matters arise, deletion will stop and the account will be restored to avoid unresolved rights or financial losses.",
  "legalDraftCancellationNoticeSection3Heading": "3. Consequences of deletion",
  "legalDraftCancellationNoticeSection3Body": "Once deletion is complete, the original account cannot be restored, login credentials become invalid, and identifiable personal information such as the nickname, phone number and avatar is deleted or anonymized. If the same WeChat account uses Chengyin again, it will be treated as a new user. Restoration of the original account’s information, content, entitlements and historical relationships is not guaranteed.",
  "legalDraftCancellationNoticeSection4Heading": "4. Data retained as required by law",
  "legalDraftCancellationNoticeSection4Body": "Records that laws or regulations require us to retain, or that are necessary to handle transactions, refunds, reconciliation, security audits and disputes, will be stored separately for the statutory or necessary period, with their use and access restricted. They will be deleted or anonymized in accordance with law when the retention period expires.",
  "legalDraftCancellationNoticeSection5Heading": "5. Withdrawal and appeals",
  "legalDraftCancellationNoticeSection5Body": "You may withdraw your application from the account deletion page during the seven-day cooling-off period. If you have questions about deletion checks, handling of funds or processing of personal information, contact 西安吾令文化传媒有限公司. Customer service telephone: 15229020419.",
