  "clubRulesCopy1": "Leaving a club",
  "clubRulesCopy2": "The owner cannot leave directly",
  "clubRulesCopy3": "Transfer ownership or dissolve the club first. (“The owner cannot leave directly; transfer ownership in member governance or dissolve the club first.”)",
  "clubRulesCopy4": "Leaving also ends membership",
  "clubRulesCopy5": "The response reports four counts: cancelled editions, blocked bills, items awaiting review, and nonrefundable items, plus whether payment has been completed.",
  "clubRulesCopy6": "Group-chat cleanup and leaving are one transaction",
  "clubRulesCopy7": "If cleanup fails, the entire operation is rolled back, so you cannot leave while retaining group access. (“Could not leave: group-chat permission cleanup is incomplete.”)",
