  "clubRulesCopy10": "The team group chat is closed at the same time.",
  "clubRulesCopy11": "Leadership transfers automatically when the leader leaves",
  "clubRulesCopy12": "Leadership passes to the earliest-joining remaining member, who is notified: “You are now the team leader.”",
  "clubRulesCopy13": "You cannot leave a team you are not in",
  "clubRulesCopy14": "(“You are not in this team.”)",
  "clubRulesCopy15": "Money after leaving (RefundPolicy is the sole source of truth)",
  "clubRulesCopy16": "Redeemed registrations are nonrefundable",
  "clubRulesCopy17": "(“Redeemed registrations cannot be refunded.”) Store Visit Day is the only exception and requires manual handling: (“Redeemed orders require manual handling.”)",
  "clubRulesCopy18": "No refund after the cutoff",
  "clubRulesCopy19": "City orienteering uses the meeting time, free exploration uses the topic validity period, and events use the start time; each has its own rule.",
  "clubRulesCopy20": "No refund inside the fulfillment window",
  "clubRulesCopy21": "(“The fulfillment window has begun; refunds are unavailable.”)",
  "clubRulesCopy22": "Unable to calculate does not mean nonrefundable",
  "clubRulesCopy23": "A missing refund deadline requires manual handling; the system cannot decide on its own. (“Refund deadline missing; manual handling required.”)",
  "clubRulesCopy24": "Pausing a station",
  "clubRulesCopy25": "A reason and estimated resumption time are both required",
  "clubRulesCopy26": "(“Select a pause reason” / “Select an estimated resumption time.”)",
  "clubRulesCopy27": "An approved backup plan must be linked",
  "clubRulesCopy28": "A backup station cannot be specified directly. (“The backup station must be resolved from an approved plan.”)",
  "clubRulesCopy29": "The station stops operating while paused",
  "clubRulesCopy30": "Players cannot submit (“Station paused”), and merchants cannot verify (“Station paused; verification unavailable”).",
  "clubRulesCopy31": "A pause affects only this station",
  "clubRulesCopy32": "Previously issued benefits and completed submissions remain unchanged.",
  "clubRulesCopy33": "Fallback completion is automatic",
  "clubRulesCopy34": "After the station is paused and a plan is linked, the server records fallback completion when the player reaches the backup station. There is no button for this.",
  "clubRulesCopy35": "Resumption requires both service windows",
  "clubRulesCopy36": "Both the event service window and the station service window must be open to resume.",
  "clubRulesCopy37": "Cancelling an entire session",
  "clubRulesCopy38": "The session is taken off sale, refunds are handled, and the waitlist ends",
  "clubRulesCopy39": "A cancellation reason of 2–255 characters is required and is sent to registered participants with the notification.",
  "clubRulesCopy40": "This page describes rules the system enforces, rather than proposals. Parentheses contain translated quotations from the source code.",
